<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Terms & Conditions | Ranchi Hair Port</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/src/assets/svgs/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
  <style type="text/tailwindcss">
    @custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/tailwind_base.css" />
  <script>
    if (localStorage.getItem('theme') === 'dark' || (!('theme' in localStorage) && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
      document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
    } else {
      document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body class="font-sans antialiased bg-[#FAF9F5] dark:bg-[#0F0F0F] text-[#1C1C1C] dark:text-[#F8F8F8] flex flex-col min-h-screen transition-colors duration-300">
  
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-stone-950 border-b border-stone-800 transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-3 md:py-0 md:h-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <button onclick="window.history.back()" aria-label="Go Back" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm sm:text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">RANCHI HAIR PORT</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button data-action="toggle-theme" aria-label="Toggle Theme" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors">
            <svg id="theme-icon" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-stone-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-8 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. In addition, when using these particular services, you shall be subject to any posted guidelines or rules applicable to such services.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">2. Service Modifications and Cancellations</h2>
            <p>Ranchi Hair Port reserves the right to modify or discontinue any service with or without notice to the user. We also reserve the right to cancel or reject any appointment at our discretion. In the event of a cancellation by our staff, reasonable efforts will be made to notify you in advance.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">3. Appointments and Punctuality</h2>
            <p>We kindly request that you arrive at least 10 minutes prior to your scheduled appointment time. Late arrivals may result in a shortened service time to ensure the next client is not delayed. We reserve the right to mark an appointment as a no-show if you are more than 15 minutes late.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">4. Payment and Pricing</h2>
            <p>All prices listed are in INR (₹) and are subject to change without notice. Final prices may vary depending on the length and density of your hair, or specific customizations requested during the service. Payment is due in full upon completion of services.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>Ranchi Hair Port is not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our services, or any damages resulting from allergic reactions to products used during services if not previously disclosed.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">6. Academy Enrollments</h2>
            <p>Enrollment in Ranchi Hair Port Academy courses is non-transferable. Once enrolled and payment is processed, refunds are subject to our Academy Refund Policy. We reserve the right to reject multiple enrollments for the same course by the same individual.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const themeBtn = document.querySelector('[data-action="toggle-theme"]');
      if(themeBtn) {
          themeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
              const isDark = document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark');
              localStorage.setItem('theme', isDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
          });
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
